b/dev is a staging tree that Pat revises freely. Work built on it
inherits that instability: when a commit beneath it changes or is
dropped, the work must be revised or abandoned, and a series posted
against it cannot be applied to trunk as sent. Trunk is the only
stable base, so work that cannot be done there is not ready yet and
should wait for its dependencies to land.
